==English==
[[File:Opossum_2.jpg|thumb|An '''opossum'''.]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|pim}} {{term|opassum||white animal|lang=pim}}; compare Ojibwe {{term|waabasim|lang=oj||white dog}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/əˈpɒsəm/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/@"pQs@m/}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|ə-päsʹəm}}, {{IPA|/əˈpɑsəm/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/@"pAs@m/}}
* {{hyphenation|o|pos|sum}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{zoology}} Any [[American]] [[marsupial]] of the [[genera]] {{taxlink|Didelphys|genus}} and {{taxlink|Chironectes|genus}}. The common species of the United States is {{taxlink|Didelphys virginiana|species}}.

====Synonyms====
* [[possum]] {{qualifier|US}}

====Derived terms====
* [[water opossum]] ({{taxlink|Chironectes variegatus|species}})<!-- of Brazil, which has the hind feet webbed, is provided with a marsupial pouch and with cheek pouches. It is called also [[yapock]].-->
* [[opossum mouse]]<!-- See [[flying mouse]]-->
* [[opossum shrimp]]<!-- any schizopod crustacean of the genus Mysis and allied genera. See [[schizopoda]].-->

